# Testing

| Kind | Where | Runner |
|------|-------|--------|
| Scoring unit | `packages/scoring-engine/src/__tests__/` | Vitest |
| Server unit | `server/src/__tests__/` | Vitest |
| PDF | `packages/pdf-engine` | Vitest |
| E2E | `e2e/tests/` | Playwright |

Commands: `npm run test`, `npm run test:e2e`.

## Rules

- New scoring/profile behavior needs unit tests in the scoring-engine package.
- Auth, critical scoring orchestration, and public-results flows deserve coverage (unit and/or e2e under `e2e/tests/`).
- Prefer deterministic fixtures over live network in unit tests.
- E2E may start the API webServer unless `SKIP_WEBSERVER` is set — don’t assume ports are free without checking.
- Do not add flaky time-based assertions; control clocks/seeds where discard/order matters.
